# PRDE Structural Stability Consensus

Status: `STRUCTURAL_PREVIEW`

Normative authority: `false`

Semantic labels: `null`

## 1. Scope

This document is the final engineering consensus for the current stability phase. It combines:

- TEST-24 orthography candidate identity;
- TEST-25 parameter / threshold stability;
- TEST-26 deterministic evidence-withholding stability;
- the predeclared `STABILITY_ACCEPTANCE_POLICY_V1.md`.

The result remains structural research only. It does not establish divine meaning, divine truth, revelation, or theological correctness.

## 2. Predeclared policy

The acceptance policy was committed before the new reproduction results were evaluated:

```text
policy commit = bbc1418bd28510ee5bd33cf44dade3844cfecec9
```

Complete-snapshot minimum TRI_TEST_PERSISTENT fractions:

```text
QREF               >= 80%
QRELATION_LOCUS    >= 80%
QMOTIF             >= 75%
QCONCEPT           >= 75%
```

TEST-26 maximum mean novel-candidate rate relative to canonical baseline:

```text
QREF               <= 5%
QRELATION_LOCUS    <= 5%
QMOTIF             <= 10%
QCONCEPT           <= 10%
```

All reproducibility gates must also pass.

